      "19145": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "count": 0,
            "bug_id": 19145,
            "text": "`clang`'s MSan unearthed a true positive issue with uninitialized reads in context.c: `cenddata` should be initialized to `NULL`.\n\nExample with problematic read of uninitialized state:\n\n```\noptions(warn = 2)\ntry(warning(\"trigger context unwind\"))\n```\n\nHere, the context created in `vwarningcall_dflt` sets the `cend` member but _not_ the `cenddata` member:\n\nhttps://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/blob/e500b3c46f60cafd0135e0cedb6d11fb7a01b40e/src/main/errors.c#L479-L482\n\nFrom what I can tell, there are number of these cases in the codebase, e.g.\n\nhttps://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/blob/e500b3c46f60cafd0135e0cedb6d11fb7a01b40e/src/main/errors.c#L608-L610\n\n```\nwithCallingHandlers(\n  warning(\"delayed warning\"),\n  warning = \\(w) stop(\"abort during warning handling\")\n)\n```\n\nSo the simplest solution is to just initialize `cenddata`.\n\n---\n\nNB: this was run on R 4.6.0, where MSan also found the issue in subset.c fixed by r90346 (Bug #19116).",
            "creation_time": "2026-08-31T23:56:24Z",
            "is_private": false,
            "id": 103502,
            "tags": [],
            "is_markdown": true,
            "creator": "michaelchirico4",
            "time": "2026-08-31T23:56:24Z",
            "attachment_id": {}
          },
          {
            "creator": "michaelchirico4",
            "is_markdown": true,
            "attachment_id": 3807,
            "time": "2026-09-01T05:28:47Z",
            "creation_time": "2026-09-01T05:28:47Z",
            "count": 1,
            "text": "Created attachment 3807\ninitialize cenddata in begincontext\n\nEnsure `cenddata` gets an explicit initial value to void `cend()` reading an uninitialized state.",
            "bug_id": 19145,
            "tags": [],
            "is_private": false,
            "id": 103503
          },
          {
            "attachment_id": 3808,
            "time": "2026-09-01T05:37:00Z",
            "creator": "michaelchirico4",
