            "id": 103504,
            "is_private": false,
            "creation_time": "2026-09-01T05:37:00Z",
            "bug_id": 19145,
            "text": "Created attachment 3808\ninitialize cenddata in begincontext\n\nI also found these redundant cases of setting `cenddata=NULL` downstream.\n\nNote that this in main.c is still required (and reiterates that the patch is correct as it matches the logic to initialize `cend=NULL` here too):\n\nhttps://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/blob/e500b3c46f60cafd0135e0cedb6d11fb7a01b40e/src/main/main.c#L1027",
            "count": 2
